    <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up"><div class="section-divider"></div><span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> Key Features</span><h2 class="section-title">What are the Features of our Gaushala Management Software?</h2><p class="section-subtitle">Here, you will get everything needed to manage and maintain the operations of Gaushalas.</p></div>
