      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-baby"></i></div><h3>Cattle Registration</h3><p>From selecting the cattle type to enrollment and proper family history tracking to insurance management, on board your cattle using our software.</p></div></div>
