      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100"><div class="feature-card"><div class="fc-icon"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div><h3>Employee Records</h3><p>Add the number of employees you want to add using our gaushala management software. Maintain and manage your employee list with comfort and peace.</p></div></div>
