          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fg2">Can I get the cattle day/month-wise milk report?</button></h2><div id="fg2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqGaushala"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, using our gaushala management software, you can get the cattle day/month-wise milk report. Everything is just set up so beautifully in our app, leaving no stress and worry for you in the process of using the app.</div></div></div>
