          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fg4">Can I edit the farm settings in the gaushala management app?</button></h2><div id="fg4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqGaushala"><div class="accordion-body">Yes, you can edit the farm settings in the gaushala management app. Just open the app, in the settings section, click on CRM setting, and proceed further to edit the details as per your needs.</div></div></div>
